# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""`super().<method>(...)` THUONG - khac han `super().__init__()`.

VI SAO CO FILE NAY (2026-09-18). Truoc khi co no, KHONG MOT file .tkv nao
trong ca repo goi `super().<method>()` thuong; ca kho chi co
`super().__init__()`. Hau qua do duoc: khi gan kieu cho accessor bieu thuc
(P8/3b buoc B1), phep do tren toan kho bao rang o1 cua kind 'method_call'
LUON la chuoi - 1796/1796 lan - va toi da ket luan nham rang nhanh xu ly
`super()` trong `record_feature.compile_method_call` la MA CHET.

That ra no SONG, va vao bang UY QUYEN chu khong qua bang dieu phoi:
`string_join.compile_method_call_expr` goi thang `compile_method_call(node, ...)`
voi chinh node 'method_call_expr'. Duong do khong qua `register_expr_codegen`
nen moi bo suy dua vao bang dang ky deu mu, va kho mau cung mu.

File nay dong lo hong do: no BUOC duong uy quyen chay o moi lan chay cong.

Ky vong: B.greet(5) -> A.greet(5) = 6. IL phai chua
`call instance int32 A::'greet'(int32)` - GOI NON-VIRTUAL dung lop cha,
khong phai `callvirt` (callvirt se quay lai B.greet va de quy vo han).
"""


class A:
    x: "i32"

    def __init__(self, x):
        self.x = x

    def greet(self, n: "i32") -> "i32":
        return n + 1


class B(A):
    y: "i32"

    def __init__(self, x, y):
        self.x = x
        self.y = y

    def greet(self, n: "i32") -> "i32":
        return super().greet(n)


def main() -> "i32":
    b = B(1, 2)
    return b.greet(5)
